  "referenceNumber": "IRN0260",
  "remarks": "\n: The Secretary of State considers that there are reasonable grounds to suspect that Ahmed AMINI is an involved person under The Iran (Sanctions) Regulations 2023 on the basis of the following ground: AMINI is or has been responsible for a serious human rights violation or abuse in Iran, namely through overseeing the violent enforcement of mandatory hijab in his role as police chief in Noor.\n",
